{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07066","headline":"酬李员外从崔录事载华宿三河戍先见寄 · 刘长卿","name":"酬李员外从崔录事载华宿三河戍先见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒江鸣石濑，归客夜初分。\n人语空山答，猨声独戍闻。\n迟来朝及暮，愁去水连云。\n岁晚心谁在，青山见此君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}